\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Non-oracle support-routed forecasting at $H1000$ on the multibasin benchmark, top-$8$ supports. The route at every step is the model's own predicted top-$8$ support (no basin labels). Each cell is the cross-rollout IQM of the routed/global $H1000$ MSE ratio (lower is better; ${<}1$ means routing helped); rollout count per cell ranges from $23$ to $158$. Markers come from a one-sided binomial sign test on per-system IQM-deltas (does the per-system IQM of $\log $(routed/global) lie below zero?), evaluated over the $8$--$16$ testable systems per (model, route) cell: $^\dagger p{<}0.05$, $^\ddagger p{<}10^{-3}$, no marker means $p\ge 0.05$. Bold marks the best IQM in each column.}}{15}{table.caption.20}\protected@file@percent }
